        "S1",
        "S3"
      ],
      "status": "unsupported"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The source attributes the library’s meaning to the board and explicitly distinguishes that meaning from a measured result.",
    "The source does not report whether sharing increased or decreased; it states that no sharing-outcome study was conducted."
  ]
